pref.perfBoost = Performance mode
pref.perfBoost.desc = Turns off heavier extras to keep the app light. Currently: system status monitoring in the status bar (CPU, memory, disk, network, app memory), icons before file names, and icons before menu items. Your other settings are kept.
pref.idleTrim = Idle memory trim (seconds)
pref.idleTrim.desc = After this many seconds without input, return the glyph cache, shell menu objects, free heap blocks and the working set to the OS. Coming back costs a brief reload. 0 = off.
